<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῠρ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of, for,</i> or <i>in money</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρος</span>
			<i>cash</i> rental, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AJA</u>
				16.13
			</span></i> (Sardes, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρικά, τά,</span>
			<i>taxes paid in money,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρικῶν πράκτωρ, πρακτορεία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				15 i 13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.306
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζημίαι ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1028.81
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					11.13.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				133.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρικῶς ἢ σωματικῶς κολασθήσονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					664.17
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
